'''Hobgoblins''' are low-to-medium levelled monsters which hit fairly accurately for their combat level. They come in two variations outside of the [[God Wars Dungeon]], with the level 28 variant usually unarmed and the level 42 variant wielding a spear, although some level 28 hobgoblins found north-east of the [[Vinery]] in [[Hosidius]] as well as one west of the Crafting Guild wield spears too. 

The narrow strip of land alongside the peninsula west of the [[Crafting Guild]], and Tree Gnome Village [[Tree Gnome Village dungeon|dungeon]] (requires a [[Key (Tree Gnome Village Dungeon)|key]]), contain many level 28 hobgoblins with no level 42 variants present.

